==Faroese==

===Etymology===
From {{der|fo|non|fótr}}, from {{der|fo|gem-pro|*fōts}}, from {{der|fo|ine-pro|*pṓds}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|fo|/ˈfɔuːtʊɹ/}}

